invalid.ts:5:16 lint/nursery/noTanstackQueryRestDestructuring ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

  ! This rest element collects every remaining property of a TanStack Query result.
  
    4 │ function AsExpression() {
  > 5 │ 	const { data, ...rest } = useQuery() as { data: string[]; isPending: boolean };
      │ 	              ^^^^^^^
    6 │ 	return rest;
    7 │ }
  
  i A query result only updates the component when a property that the component reads changes. Collecting the remaining properties reads all of them, so the component updates on every change to the query.
  
  i Remove the rest element and list the properties that you need.
  
  i This rule belongs to the nursery group, which means it is not yet stable and may change in the future. Visit https://biomejs.dev/linter/#nursery for more information.
  

